        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 925SQ, Contempo Lever with Matching Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contempo Leverset with Square Rose is on the cutting edge of what is the most stylish and popular in home design. This sleek <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy</b></a> 925 lever paired with the ultra-modern square rose is great for new construction as well as diy home updates. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from 8 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, satin brass, satin nickel, and polished chrome. Available for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 925SQ Contempo Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>28° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 925SQ Modern Lever with Square Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Door Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contempo Leverset with Square Rose, Omnia 925SQ",
                "description": "Omnia 925SQ, Contempo Leverset with Square Rose - The Contempo Leverset with Square Rose is on the cutting edge of what is the most stylish and popular in home design. The sleek lever paired with the ultra-modern square rose is great for new construction as well as diy home updates. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Choose from 8 finishes including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished chrome. Available for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets for 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors.",
                "keywords": "Contempo Leverset with Square Roses, Omnia 925SQ, Modern 925 Lever with Square Rosettes, Omnia 925SQ Contempo Leverset, square roses, privacy levers, passage levers, solid brass levers, omnia prodigy collections, Modern Lever with Square Rosettes, Contempo Leversets, Contempo Lever with Matching Square Roses,"
